
Real Life — Payment Gateway
Tu Swiggy pe order kiya — payment karna hai.
Options hain:
UPI
Credit Card
Debit Card
Net Banking
Wallet
Tu UPI select kiya — payment process hua — success ya failure.

Kaun se patterns use honge:
Strategy  → har payment method alag algorithm
Factory   → payment method object banana
Observer  → payment status change pe notify
Facade    → sab ek simple interface se
Singleton → PaymentLogger — ek hi hoga

Classes jo banegi:
IPaymentStrategy     → base — pay()
UPIPayment           → UPI se pay
CreditCardPayment    → card se pay
WalletPayment        → wallet se pay

PaymentFactory       → strategy banata hai
PaymentLogger        → Singleton — log karta hai
PaymentObserver      → notify karta hai
PaymentProcessor     → Facade — sab coordinate karta hai

Final Output:
[LOG] Payment initiated : 500 via UPI
[NOTIFY] Payment processing...
✅ UPI Payment successful : 500
[NOTIFY] Payment successful!
[LOG] Payment completed : 500 via UPI